hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1001","Ahmad ibn Abdah informed us, Hammad, meaning Ibn Zayd, informed us, on the authority of Ayyub, on the authority of Abu Qilaba, and Yazid al-Rashk, on the authority of Muadhah, that A woman asked Aisha: “Does a menstruating woman make up for prayer?” She said: Are you a Hurriyah? She used to menstruate, so she is not ordered to make up for prayer. She said: And she mentioned: She asked the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace."
